OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity staff to be balloted on
OL,4,Astrike action
OL,5,
OL,6,FStaff at the University of Birmingham
OL,7,Fare to vote on whether to take
OL,8,Findustrial action in a dispute over
OL,9,Fplanned redundancies affecting
OL,10,Ftranslation and interpreting staff.
OL,12,FThe University and College Union (UCU)
OL,13,Fsaid five employees, all from migrant
OL,14,For minority ethnic backgrounds, were at
OL,15,Frisk of losing their jobs.
OL,17,FA formal ballot is due to be held.
