OL,5,
OL,6,FThe university has been contacted for
OL,7,Fcomment, but in a previous statement a
OL,8,Fspokesperson said falling demand for
OL,9,Fcertain provision had led to the
OL,10,Fproposals and the university remained
OL,11,Fsatisfied that it had carried out a
OL,12,F"meaningful consultation".
